			"Message": "refactor(Sky): Disable telemetry by default and align configuration logic\n\nUpdate OTELBridge.ts to set telemetry capture and OTLP piping to disabled by default. The environment variables 'Capture' and 'OTLPEnabled' now require explicit 'true' values to enable, rather than defaulting to 'true' unless set to 'false'.\n\nThis aligns with the project's privacy-first approach and ensures telemetry is completely off unless explicitly opted into by the user or build configuration. The logic now explicitly checks for 'true' instead of checking for the absence of 'false', making the opt-in requirement clear and consistent with the 'Capture=false' master kill switch comment.",
